Polymarket @Polymarket 的格局形成鲜明对比：\n\nhttps://t.co/6vfPqvdOkT\n\nUI 界面几乎一样，但路线完全不同👇\n\n一个是监管合规代表（Kalshi）打穿华尔街，\n另一个去中心化代表（Polymarket）野性开荒 Web3\n但都是围绕「下注现实世界」的核心路线。\n\n这些大哥们什么时候发币？你更看好谁先发？"}}}}}}}}}))($R["tsr"]);document.currentScript.remove()</script><div hidden id="S:0"><div class="relative h-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[600px]" id="urt:conversation:1938990953660064207:none:default"><ul><li><div class="outline-blue-500 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 px-horizontal py-vertical border-b border-gray-100" data-timeline-entry="" tabindex="-1"><article class="flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex w-10 shrink-0 justify-center self-stretch"><div class="relative z-10"><a class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] rounded-none active" href="/KuiGas" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-full size-10 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@KuiGas" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="40px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_400x400.jpg 400w"/></div></a></div>